    "la_privacy_header": "Live Activity privacy policy",
    "la_privacy_intro": "We have to store and process certain data for use in the Live Activity function. Please, read the disclosure below.",
    "la_privacy_section1_title": "What data do we store?",
    "la_privacy_section1_body": "For the Live Activity to function, we store the below data with your device identifier:\n\n• Device Identifier (UUID)\n• Device token\n• Live Activity push token\n• APNs push token\n• Device hash\n• Language setting\n• Bell delay\n\nYour timetable data (lessons table) contains the following:\n• The subject and time of the lesson\n• The name of the teacher\n• The name of the classroom\n• Period number of the lesson\n• The topic of the lesson\n• Details of a substitution\n• Indication of dismissed lesson\n\nThe scheduled notifications (scheduled_notifications table) contains the following:\n• Identifier\n• Device identifier\n• Scheduled time\n• Status and time of notification\n• Time of creation and update",
    "la_privacy_section2_title": "How do we protect your data?",
    "la_privacy_section2_body": "We take the security of your data seriously:\n\n• The data in the \"devices\" and \"lessons\" tables are encrypted\n• We store the data on secure servers\n• We only store data for as long as we need it",
    "la_privacy_section3_title": "How long do we store data for?",
    "la_privacy_section3_body": "We store data for the least amount of time possible:\n\n• Live Activity push token: Only stored as long as you have lessons on the given day (including the 2-hour period before). If you don't have any lessons left, the value becomes zero.\n\n• Timetable data: Only stored for the length of the lessons and they're deleted automatically. On Fridays, the table containing the timetable will be completely empty after the last lesson.\n\n• Device data (token, identifiers): Stored for as long as the Live Activity function is enabled. This data gets deleted when disabling the function.",
    "la_privacy_section4_title": "What do we use the data for?",
    "la_privacy_section4_body": "We use the data exclusively for the Live Activity function:\n\n• Displaying a live timetable on your lockscreen\n• Sending push notifications when lessons change\n• Synchronizing the timetable on your device\n• Ensuring the Monday morning notifications get delivered even after the weekly database-clearing.\n\nWe don't share your data with third parties and we don't use them for marketing.",
    "la_privacy_section5_title": "Your rights",
    "la_privacy_section5_body": "Under the GDPR, you have the following rights:\n\n• Right of access: You can view the type of data stored in this privacy policy.\n• Right to erasure: By disabling the Live Activity function, all data related to the function (device identifiers, timetable) will be immediately and permanently deleted from our servers.\n• Right to modification: The timetable data is modified in the Kréta system by authorized persons (e.g. teachers).\n• Right to object: You can object to data processing at any time by disabling the Live Activity function.",
    "la_privacy_footer": "This privacy policy was last updated on: November 2025",
    "la_privacy_contact": "Do you have any questions? Contact us at support@firka.app.",
    "la_privacy_summary1": "Device tokens, Live Activity tokens, timetable data",
    "la_privacy_summary2": "Encrypted storage, secure servers",
    "la_privacy_summary3": "Data is automatically deleted when it is no longer needed.",
